SUMMARY:2027 Indiana Sustainability and Resilience Conference
DESCRIPTION:The 2027 Indiana Sustainability and Resilience Conference (ht
 tps://eri.iu.edu/news-and-events/events/indiana-sustainability-and-resili
 ence-conference.html#current) (ISRC) will be held Friday\, Feb. 5 at the 
 Embassy Suites Event Center in Plainfield\, Ind.  Hosted by the IU Enviro
 nmental Resilience Institute and presenting sponsor the Indianapolis Airp
 ort Authority\, ISRC is the state's premiere gathering for climate leader
 s across sectors to accelerate action toward a healthier\, more sustainab
 le future.  Registration includes a full day of conference activities and
  a buffet lunch. Space is limited\; individuals are encouraged to reserve
  a seat well in advance of the event.What: One-day gathering of sustainab
 ility and resilience champions from government\, higher education\, nonpr
 oﬁt\, and corporate organizations.Where: Embassy Suites Event Center in
  Plainfield\, Ind.When: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Friday\, Feb. 5\, 2027
